      "text": "The Maclaurin series for \\( e^{x} \\) is \\( \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{x^{n}}{n!} \\), which converges for every real \\( x \\). Find the exact value of \\( \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{(-1)^{n}}{2^{n}\\,n!} \\)."
