         "text": "Each term has the form \\( \\frac{x^{n}}{n!} \\) with \\( x = - \\frac{1}{2} \\), so this is the Maclaurin series for \\( e^{x} \\) evaluated at \\( x = - \\frac{1}{2} \\).",
